## 1. chunk.h - LineStart Structure and Updated Chunk

The LineStart structure records the byte offset and the source line number. The Chunk structure stores a dynamic array of these records.

```c
typedef struct {
  int offset;
  int line;
} LineStart;

typedef struct {
  int count;
  int capacity;
  uint8_t* code;
  ValueArray constants;

  int lineCount;
  int lineCapacity;
  LineStart* lines;
} Chunk;
```

The function declarations are:

```c
void initChunk(Chunk* chunk);
void freeChunk(Chunk* chunk);
void writeChunk(Chunk* chunk, uint8_t byte, int line);
int addConstant(Chunk* chunk, Value value);
int getLine(Chunk* chunk, int instruction);
```

