## 2. chunk.c - Initialize the Chunk

I updated initChunk() to initialize the compressed line array separately from the bytecode array.

```c
void initChunk(Chunk* chunk) {
  chunk->count = 0;
  chunk->capacity = 0;
  chunk->code = NULL;

  chunk->lineCount = 0;
  chunk->lineCapacity = 0;
  chunk->lines = NULL;

  initValueArray(&chunk->constants);
}
```

