## 6. debug.c - Update Line Information Display

In disassembleInstruction(), I replaced the original line-number lookup with getLine().

```c
int disassembleInstruction(Chunk* chunk, int offset) {
  printf("%04d ", offset);

  int line = getLine(chunk, offset);

  if (offset > 0 &&
      line == getLine(chunk, offset - 1)) {
    printf("   | ");
  } else {
    printf("%4d ", line);
  }

